+      <h1 class="post-title">How I season a cast iron skillet in the oven</h1>
       <p class="meta">By Maya Lindqvist · Published March 14, 2026</p>
 
       <p>I bought my 12-inch skillet at a yard sale for $8. It had rust spots on the bottom and a sticky, uneven layer on the cooking surface. These are the steps I used to strip it back and build up a new seasoning in my home oven, over one afternoon.</p>
